ymuqfwqdbc01wsdukhuymydopmno2d.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_003_kalts/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/hzmi9kz2r47ug7r2mb5qed5it7budz9.mp3","text":"新年到了。希望你能以适当的方式合理度过这个短暂的假期。并且祝愿你能健康度过这一年，不要在医务室浪费太多时间。","alt":"voice/char_003_kalts/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/n80d7av36qrndey39iwnkt67ltwdsyr.mp3","text":"博士。","alt":"voice/char_003_kalts/cn_042.mp3"}]}}